# Netlify/Vercel Redirects Configuration
# Redirect bhaskarvilles.blog to bhaskar.blog (primary domain)

# Redirect alternate domain to primary domain with 301 (permanent redirect)
https://bhaskarvilles.blog/*  https://bhaskar.blog/:splat  301!
http://bhaskarvilles.blog/*   https://bhaskar.blog/:splat  301!

# Ensure www redirects to non-www for both domains
https://www.bhaskar.blog/*         https://bhaskar.blog/:splat         301!
https://www.bhaskarvilles.blog/*   https://bhaskar.blog/:splat         301!
http://www.bhaskar.blog/*          https://bhaskar.blog/:splat         301!
http://www.bhaskarvilles.blog/*    https://bhaskar.blog/:splat         301!
